  <name>Sanaga</name>
  <summary>A fast, light web browser</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="fr">Un navigateur web léger et rapide</summary>
  <developer id="site.grassfield">
    <name>Grassfield</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>Sanaga is a web browser built on WebKitGTK, light on memory and private by default.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Containers: tabs with their own cookies and logins</li>
      <li>A network blocker of ads and trackers, and settings for each website</li>
      <li>Tab groups, vertical tree tabs, reader, page summaries</li>
      <li>Floating video, focus mode, link preview, PDF reader</li>
      <li>A mobile simulator for web developers</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">site.grassfield.Sanaga.desktop</launchable>
